{"2560540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Historia Realis: Rome", "steam_appid": 2560540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/3f3de35edbe2df2ba0b4f1e41a0703a6.poster.avif?t=1783381004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/3f3de35edbe2df2ba0b4f1e41a0703a6.webm?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/3f3de35edbe2df2ba0b4f1e41a0703a6.mp4?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of history and strategize your way to greatness in this character-driven, deep simulation of Ancient Rome!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/f7890bea05dfe6da5d0e439a9edcad0b.avif?t=1783381004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras_big/f7890bea05dfe6da5d0e439a9edcad0b.avif?t=1783381004 width=1560 height=142 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassinate rivals, seduce lovers and betray friends. Join mystery cults, study philosophy or cultivate grapes. Total freedom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play either as historical characters like Caesar, Pompey, Sulla and Marius, or randomly generated ones, forging your own legacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the transformation of Rome into a Mediterranean empire, and play a big or small role in its history.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/8af023cf355bee1e475aa0fe4fab790c.poster.avif?t=1783381004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/8af023cf355bee1e475aa0fe4fab790c.webm?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/8af023cf355bee1e475aa0fe4fab790c.mp4?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/2a03b0f1b0d5b55828e2493cdf9a7436.avif?t=1783381004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras_big/2a03b0f1b0d5b55828e2493cdf9a7436.avif?t=1783381004 width=1560 height=142 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in the legions or study rhetoric. Become a lawyer, a priest or a conqueror. It's your history!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on any of five different attributes: Martial, Oratory, Cunning, Administration and Piety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a full life, embarking on many different and flavorful endeavors from childhood to adulthood. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/a417a7a9d4e175eff7f5129ef59bda8c.poster.avif?t=1783381004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/a417a7a9d4e175eff7f5129ef59bda8c.webm?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/a417a7a9d4e175eff7f5129ef59bda8c.mp4?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/c6cf2073ff3ebcc4806d8707744c1a3e.avif?t=1783381004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras_big/c6cf2073ff3ebcc4806d8707744c1a3e.avif?t=1783381004 width=1560 height=142 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a Senator, pass laws and pull the strings from the shadows. Gain power and climb the social ladder!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win elections and rise from lower to higher offices, from Quaestor to Praetor and Consul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass or block motions and laws in the Senate. Be careful not to make powerful enemies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/efb9d6d99c08a6b712371bb69250fa80.poster.avif?t=1783381004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/efb9d6d99c08a6b712371bb69250fa80.webm?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/efb9d6d99c08a6b712371bb69250fa80.mp4?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/44a505cac85036da85124b88744bff15.avif?t=1783381004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras_big/44a505cac85036da85124b88744bff15.avif?t=1783381004 width=1560 height=142 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your career as a junior officer on a commander’s staff. Prove yourself and rise through the ranks to lead Rome’s armies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight wars at different levels: as a Tribune, a Legate or a Commander, each with their own unique roles and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Govern the provinces peacefully or use the opportunity to expand Rome's borders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/20ca964390b392d0ef01c80828c398dd.poster.avif?t=1783381004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/20ca964390b392d0ef01c80828c398dd.webm?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/20ca964390b392d0ef01c80828c398dd.mp4?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/934bc3641dbaa82b8388434514f34f22.avif?t=1783381004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras_big/934bc3641dbaa82b8388434514f34f22.avif?t=1783381004 width=1560 height=142 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with thousands of NPCs, each with their own goals, feelings and relationships. A detailed simulation of Roman society awaits you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise from the bottom of an intricate social ladder all the way to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge bonds and social alliances with other characters. Call on favors and develop grudges and rivalries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/79b2e8a462529453779adc92cee52489.poster.avif?t=1783381004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/79b2e8a462529453779adc92cee52489.webm?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/79b2e8a462529453779adc92cee52489.mp4?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/cebbd410c671c759a90f335c65a279ee.avif?t=1783381004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras_big/cebbd410c671c759a90f335c65a279ee.avif?t=1783381004 width=1560 height=142 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get married, have children and continue playing as your heirs. Make your family's name echo throughout the ages!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your children to live with allied families, or take wards into your own household, allowing characters to teach skills to each other and form lifelong relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the next generations by arranging marriages and educating your children. Leave behind an example for them to follow or rebel against.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/654ef0368294af29db3691985d10e3d8.poster.avif?t=1783381004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/654ef0368294af29db3691985d10e3d8.webm?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar