on of Roman society awaits you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise from the bottom of an intricate social ladder all the way to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge bonds and social alliances with other characters. Call on favors and develop grudges and rivalries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/79b2e8a462529453779adc92cee52489.poster.avif?t=1783381004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/79b2e8a462529453779adc92cee52489.webm?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/79b2e8a462529453779adc92cee52489.mp4?t=1783381004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras/cebbd410c671c759a90f335c65a279ee.avif?t=1783381004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560540/extras_big/cebbd410c671c759a90f335c65a279ee.avif?t=1783381004 width=1560 height=142 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get married, have children and continue playing as your heirs. Make your family's name echo throughout the ages!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your children to live with allied families, or take wards into your own household, allowing characters to teach skills to each other and form lifelong relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the next generations by arranging marriages and educating your children. Leave behind an example for them to follow or rebel against.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut